  "$comment": "IBM Plex, as IBM publishes it in its npm packages, kept unmodified in this folder rather than installed, because both packages run IBM's telemetry tool when they are installed (web-ui: Fonts served by the install; design.md, Design: Type and the self-hosted fonts; D57 (3)). Each package's tarball was fetched with npm pack, which runs no install script, and checked against the registry's integrity; each file is listed with its path in the package and its SHA-256, which packages/commands/test/fonts.test.ts checks. OFL.txt is IBM's license.txt from the same folders, the SIL Open Font License 1.1 with IBM's copyright notice. To update, repeat this for a newer release in a reviewed pull request.",
